# Shared by the station scenarios (sb_*): the login against a live server (e2e.py run --live: the local Net-7
# server, account admin / admin), character select, the starbase the character is docked in. Not run on its own.
# Events are the live antprox's lines, named by e2e.py (name_live): 'received NAME' the client's, 'sent NAME' the
# server's. The account part is _login_live_account's; slot 0 is Zanor (avatar 6, docked).
include _login_live_account
click gadget select.slot0
click gadget select.enter until antprox 'received LOGIN' redo 1 every 1 within 60
wait-event antprox 'received START_ACK' within 120
# the starbase loads its rooms and avatars (no log line for "drawn": its file opens end)
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 60
